  {
    "@id": "https://www.champagneweather.com/event-details/americana-ukulele-workshop",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#title": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Americana Ukulele (Workshop) | Champagne Weather"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Based on James&#39; course &#34;Americana Ukulele,&#34; this 75-minute workshop is open to all levels. Bring your ukulele and be ready to strum, pick, sing and explore the sounds of traditional American music (country, bluegrass, and old-time). Learn more about James&#39; online &#34;Americana Ukulele&#34; course and take a free lesson here: <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.uketropolis.com/americana\">https://www.uketropolis.com/americana</a>.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Open to all levels. Please bring a ukulele tuned in C6 tuning (G, C, E, A). If you&#39;re a baritone player, please be prepared to place a capo on the 5th fret in order to follow along with the content of this workshop. If you have one, please bring a music stand.</em></p>"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/cae735_468126471d2541b3b560d9aeae21e777~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1294,h_728,al_c,q_85/cae735_468126471d2541b3b560d9aeae21e777~mv2.jpg"
      }
    ],
